---
description: Protect secrets and environment variables
alwaysApply: true
---

- never print or document real secret values
- never copy `.env` contents wholesale into generated docs
- client-exposed environment variables are public
- never move secret values into NEXT_PUBLIC_, VITE_, EXPO_PUBLIC_ or equivalent client-visible config
- update `.env.example` with names/placeholders only
- prefer workload identity/secret stores over hard-coded cloud credentials
